"seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "keep_model_loaded"}, "name": "keep_model_loaded", "label": "keep_model_loaded", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "keep_model_loaded"}, {"widget": {"name": "pause_after_speaker"}, "name": "pause_after_speaker", "label": "pause_after_speaker", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "pause_after_speaker"}, {"widget": {"name": "num_speakers"}, "name": "num_speakers", "label": "num_speakers", "type": "COMFY_DYNAMICCOMBO_V3", "localized_name": "num_speakers"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "num_speakers.speaker_1_audio", "label": "num_speakers.speaker_1_audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "speaker_1_audio"}, {"widget": {"name": "num_speakers.speaker_1_ref_text"}, "shape": 7, "name": "num_speakers.speaker_1_ref_text", "label": "num_speakers.speaker_1_ref_text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "speaker_1_ref_text"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "num_speakers.speaker_2_audio", "label": "num_speakers.speaker_2_audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "speaker_2_audio"}, {"widget": {"name": "num_speakers.speaker_2_ref_text"}, "shape": 7, "name": "num_speakers.speaker_2_ref_text", "label": "num_speakers.speaker_2_ref_text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "speaker_2_ref_text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 10, "type": "LongCatMultiSpeakerTTS", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LongCatMultiSpeakerTTS"}, "order": 26}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [84], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "size": [484.1860046386719, 920.0782470703125], "pos": [514.8114013671875, 1355.48583984375], "widgets_values": ["[speaker_1]: 哼，你挺有大厂病啊！\n[speaker_1]: 包组长要是再让你多带两年项目，\n[speaker_1]: 恐怕连董事长你都不放在眼里了吧！\n[speaker_2]: 我当然不放在眼里，\n[speaker_2]: 董事长那是写进公司愿景里用来尊重的，\n[speaker_2]: 像你这样整天把大老板挂在嘴边狐假虎威，简直是职场污染！\n[speaker_2]: 你存的什么心？\n[speaker_2]: 你爹妈把你供出大学校园，\n[speaker_2]: 你跑去给资本当舔狗就是自轻自贱，\n[speaker_2]: 不拿核心业务说话只知道站队，就是浪费资源，\n[speaker_2]: 你这个不产出只添乱的职场废柴，\n[speaker_2]: 赖在会议室里蹭什么WIFI？\n[speaker_1]: 你好大的胆子！\n[speaker_1]: 你竟然敢公开怼我？\n[speaker_2]: 我身为这个项目的首席负责人，\n[speaker_2]: 在这个会议室里我拥有最高决策权！\n[speaker_2]: 你区区一个内勤部门的挂名经理，\n[speaker_2]: 只是来陪跑列席的。\n[speaker_2]: 我还在复盘数据你竟敢在这儿玩手机？\n[speaker_2]: 我不怼你我怼谁啊我！\n[speaker_1]: 好！等我发邮件给HR总监，\n[speaker_1]: 把你给裁……\n[speaker_2]: 裁你老母啊！你要是今天能走出这间办公室，\n[speaker_2]: 就算你有本事！\n[speaker_2]: 来人！断网，收手机！"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 70, "type": "TextInput_", "title": "文本", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-mixlab-nodes", "ver": "32b22c39cbe13b46df29ef1b6ab088c2eb4389d2", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.7"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "Node name for S&R": "TextInput_"}, "order": 15}, {"outputs": [{"name": "output", "label": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["二零二六年一定要装全屋智能的几个理由，第一，全屋智能确实让生活变方便了，老人小孩就算不会，照样能用传统方式控制家电、灯光、窗帘等设备，像人来灯亮这类自动化设置好了，就能做到无感智能。第二，安装门槛变低了，现在全屋智能攻略到处都有，无论是水电还是调试，大家或多或少都懂点，而且设备价格透明，比全屋智能刚出的时候便宜。第三，由于全屋智能的兴起，各类厂家工作室的服务更加规范，服务也更好了，想找到一个能听懂需求的乙方也更简单了。所以二零二六年一定要把智能列入装修清单，让自己的家更有仪式感。"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 46, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "type": "easy showAnything", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [344.067138671875, 205.76272583007812], "pos": [-537.0286254882812, 897.2084350585938], "id": 26, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 45}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "AUDIO", "links": [], "label": "AUDIO", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "AUDIO"}], "size": [413.18017578125, 136], "pos": [-1513.462890625, 492.6724853515625], "widgets_values": ["26d9a3ffb24a1ec9d15ddd5a6a5fc1be4321d4b07d779bf388a6bc92287e3dc8.mp3", null, null], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "audio"}, "name": "aud